[00:00.00] 
[00:07.04] Ke Ab Kuch Hosh Nahi Hai
[00:10.15] Tu Mujhko Pila Degi Kya
[00:13.18] Mein Pi Kar Jo Bhi Kahunga
[00:16.57] Tu Subha Bhula Degi Kya
[00:19.66] Tu Bahon Mein Rakhle Do Pal
[00:23.02] Phir Chahe Dur Hata De
[00:26.15] Mein Godh Mein Rakh Lun Agar Sar
[00:29.44] Tu Mujhko Sula Degi Kya
[00:31.96] Jaati Nahi Teri Yaadein Kasam Se
[00:35.05] Ke Dil Ka Bharam Hai Tu
[00:38.31] Baaki Nahi Ab Koi Sharam Jana
[00:41.54] Ek Dharam Hai Tu
[00:44.56] Jo Kehti Thi Mat Piyo Na
[00:47.60] Meri Jaan Zeher Hai Yeh
[00:50.79] Usey Dekhta Hoon Koi Gair Chhuye
[00:54.01] Ab Aur Zeher Kya Piyu
[00:57.63] 